    "committer": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "message": "Fix BiocDuckDB Bioconductor nebbiolo2 check NOTEs\n\nVendor a local .sampleMapFromData() helper instead of calling\nunexported MultiAssayExperiment:::.sampleMapFromData() from\n.newMAE(). Add BiocBaseUtils to Imports for its own\nselectSome() dependency.\n\nFix a malformed \\link[BiocSingular]{BiocSingularParam} Rd\ncross-reference (no matching alias; real target is\nBiocSingularParam-class) and anchor unanchored\n\\linkS4class{DuckDBMatrix}/\\linkS4class{DuckDBArraySeed}\nreferences to \\link[DuckDBArray]{...}.\n",
    "time": 1794091907
  },
